                            @T["In order to ensure that every sip of tea delivers a delightful and refined taste experience, the training of our tea baristas involves meticulous practice in every detail, from the precise use of ice and tea quantity to the consistent shaking gestures. Only through such dedication can the intricate nuances of a good tea be consistently expressed, creating a lingering and memorable aftertaste with each sip."]
